Training-data caveat
--------------------

The upstream author states that the Generalization checkpoint was trained on
LOLv2-Synthetic with random gamma. The canonical LOLv2 source repository
(https://github.com/flyywh/CVPR-2020-Semi-Low-Light, commit
9f383decbd2717ab37bb9e4c133b3a0bf98ba638) publishes no dataset LICENSE or
explicit use terms. The checkpoint publisher directly grants MIT terms for the
released model artifact, but LibreYOLO has not independently established the
training dataset's commercial-use terms. No LOLv2 images or other training data
are included or redistributed by LibreYOLO.
